  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This applies more for le peeps with a VR Headset.\nIt would be nice to be able to have our system time next to the mic icon, the ability to change it to 12h/24h format too and be able to disable it.\n\nI don't know why this isn't a thing, no issue of having it right? I've seen multiple VR users being like \"What time is it?\" and they take about 15sec or something just to go check by taking off their headset or trying to open a 'different' window/menu.\n\nBut maybe there's a really fast way of doing it and I don't know about it.",
